       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. AUDITLOG.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-REC  PIC X(20).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-REC.
           EXEC SQL
             INSERT INTO AUDIT_LOG (REC, TS)
               VALUES (:LK-REC, CURRENT TIMESTAMP)
           END-EXEC.
           CALL 'CEE3ABD'.
           GOBACK.
